From 44f2dc36612a54891dac46fd208ea80ea707c8af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:24:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash commands so slash input
 targets backend commands

Selected-agent chat input that starts with a slash is routed through the backend command channel instead of ordinary prompts. Providers opt into the command path through defaulted AgentBackend methods, and Codex resumes the selected thread with the raw slash command.
